{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳多張照片，顯示一對男女在港鐵車廂及街頭等公眾地方，做出猥褻動作。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"770678174_17949193011246758_8386824230510873534_n.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026CMHzGbslfc1786590770.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"770678174_17949193011246758_8386824230510873534_n.JPG\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據照片顯示，事發於港鐵車廂內，當時車上不乏其他乘客，畫面中一名身穿短款背心及短褲的女子坐在外籍男子腿上，男方則公然將右手伸入女方的裙內，畫面極為不雅。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"772708078_17952521349250324_7995440497332370337_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026YM5UntNAxB1786590787.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"772708078_17952521349250324_7995440497332370337_n.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">照片隨即引來大批網民熱議及，批評兩人行為欠缺克制，留言表示：「成何體統」、「公眾地方好心克制下」、「好唔尊重女性！」。此外，亦有網民指兩人疑為「慣犯」，並上載另一張於夜間街頭等候過馬路時拍攝的照片，相中可見該名男子同樣將手伸手入女方裙內。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ca013c81-1cb1-457b-a5f9-1f085d9032e9.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Rc0O9hHsRr1786590795.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ca013c81-1cb1-457b-a5f9-1f085d9032e9.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T03:40:27.425119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}